From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 14:26:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] DN2026_0004 feat(shorts): immediate manual publish, anti-bot
 delays 1-10 min

- timing=now (SHORTS_IGNORE_WINDOW): first post without delay
- SHORTS_FIRST_JITTER_MIN 5-40 -> 1-10, SHORTS_GAP_MIN 120-200 -> 1-10, GAP_FLOOR 90 -> 1
- docs/tests updated; change points tagged DN2026_0004
